    "updated_at": "2017-03-17T07:31:59Z",
    "body": "So it's not that simple. The changed tests cause failures in all browsers. They all use NAMESPACE_ERR for some set of invalid names currently. So bz expressed willingness to change that so that name validation uses a single exception, but seeing the results we'd need explicit sign-off from @tkent-google and @cdumez too, at least.",
